{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/6bb0ec63f4633c03aa1177487fe383fd.avif?t=1757992165\" data-has-big width=1560 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We went to the essence of Calm Skies and re-made it from the ground up (the clouds down?) for our major Trailblazer Edition update. In this new edition, you can look forward to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Better Flying</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Power-ups Added</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dashing Mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revamped Terrain Generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Engaging Obstacle Spawning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved Models and Lighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many more improvements!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just part of our initiative to bring more free content and updates to Calm Skies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/c0e5e7873412485b8ab5c7f41c739fd1.avif?t=1757992165\" data-has-big width=1560 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill and tranquility of flying in Calm Skies. Perfect your wingsuit skills as you explore diverse biomes, dodge obstacles, and perform daring tricks to complete skill-testing challenges. Customize your character and enjoy a unique blend of excitement and serenity in the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/2a2cbc4482c1c75ff7380fc53e2e5236.avif?t=1757992165\" data-has-big width=1560 height=144 /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/197edb16105454fbfb51f28b9f1d8c07.poster.avif?t=1757992165\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/197edb16105454fbfb51f28b9f1d8c07.webm?t=1757992165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/197edb16105454fbfb51f28b9f1d8c07.mp4?t=1757992165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the rush of adrenaline as you glide close to the ground and obstacles, perfecting your flight skills to build an impressive high score. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/049455623ccb57ec2432f9e36fbfee4e.avif?t=1757992165\" data-has-big width=1560 height=144 /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/f461c16a3ca36304c1aa21722c98b8cb.poster.avif?t=1757992165\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/f461c16a3ca36304c1aa21722c98b8cb.webm?t=1757992165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/f461c16a3ca36304c1aa21722c98b8cb.mp4?t=1757992165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your reflexes and agility as you maneuver around trees, hills, and narrow gaps on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src