.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/643d3a4cf00286e513b8e8678a7817f9.mp4?t=1757992165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your score by performing daring tricks and flying through rings scattered across the skies. Complete engaging challenges that push your flying abilities, and be rewarded with Wings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/17d88112b992425adaa40335319fa7f9.avif?t=1757992165\" data-has-big width=1560 height=144 /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/cdb548c8908eb0450680ae328afd67d3.poster.avif?t=1757992165\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/cdb548c8908eb0450680ae328afd67d3.webm?t=1757992165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/cdb548c8908eb0450680ae328afd67d3.mp4?t=1757992165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your wingsuit character with a variety of customization options to make your character truly your own. Unlock new customizations as you earn more Wings from challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive flight mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration in diverse biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill Testing Challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated world</p></li><li><p clas