kies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/c0e5e7873412485b8ab5c7f41c739fd1.avif?t=1757992165\" data-has-big width=1560 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill and tranquility of flying in Calm Skies. Perfect your wingsuit skills as you explore diverse biomes, dodge obstacles, and perform daring tricks to complete skill-testing challenges. Customize your character and enjoy a unique blend of excitement and serenity in the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/2a2cbc4482c1c75ff7380fc53e2e5236.avif?t=1757992165\" data-has-big width=1560 height=144 /></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/197edb16105454fbfb51f28b9f1d8c07.poster.avif?t=1757992165\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/197edb16105454fbfb51f28b9f1d8c07.webm?t=1757992165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/197edb16105454fbfb51f28b9f1d8c07.mp4?t=1757992165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the rush of adrenaline as you glide close to the ground and obstacles, perfecting your flight skills to build an impressive high score. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056110/extras/049455623ccb57ec2432f9e36fbfee4e.avif?t